# Local source material (do not commit): manufacturer flight manuals /
# QRHs / checklists are copyrighted third-party PDFs, plus their full-text
# extractions and the raw podcast audio staging area. We author our own quiz
# questions / prose from them; only that committed derivative content belongs
# in git. Everything lives under one ignored umbrella folder:
/_source/

# Copyrighted source PDFs that live under public/ (kept out of git; the
# derived model-data JSON alongside them is committed)
public/aw169/QRH EP AW169/
public/aw139/qrh/*.pdf

# Full-text extraction dumps, wherever a script drops them
*-rfm-pages.txt
*-qrh-pages.txt
*-ecl-pages.txt
*-poh-pages.txt
*-fflm-pages.txt
*-flm-pages.txt
*-pcl-pages.txt
*-debug-pages.txt
*_index.txt

# next-pwa generated assets change per build; do not track
public/sw.js
public/workbox-*.js
public/fallback-*.js

# Generated native offline shell (regenerate with `npm run native:shell`)
/public-native/
